        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871350/extras/67397f8ee65491dedae28ccee6798f6b.avif?t=1758211233\" width=542 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadows of Betrayal</i> is a mystery/thriller visual novel about a group of recent high school graduates who set out for a trip to a remote cabin. The game is set in current day but with 80s/90s horror vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the intriguing friend group, enjoy the banter, plot twists and optional romance, and try to survive the unexpected events in Shadows of Betrayal while solving the multi-layered mystery! Who will survive, and at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will it all unravel? The answers lie in <i>Shadows of Betrayal</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interesting story with unexpected plot twists</li><li>Well written characters with engaging and witty dialogue</li><li>Meaningful choices</li><li>Relationship system that gives you feedback of what people think of your actions</li><li>Toggleable map that shows you where the current scene is taking place</li><li>First person narrative</li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871350/extras/67397f8ee65491dedae28ccee6798f6b.avif?t=1758211233\" width=542 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadows of Betrayal</i> is a mystery/thriller visual novel about a group of recent high school graduates who set out for a trip to a remote cabin. The game is set in current day but with 80s/90s horror vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the intriguing friend group, enjoy the banter, plot twists and optional romance, and try to survive the unexpected events in Shadows of Betrayal while solving the multi-layered mystery! Who will survive, and at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will it all unravel? The answers lie in <i>Shadows of Betrayal</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interesting story with unexpected plot twists</li><li>Well written characters with engaging and witty dialogue</li><li>Meaningful choices</li><li>Relationship system that gives you feedback of what people think of your actions</li><li>Toggleable map that shows you where the current scene is taking place</li><li>First person narrative</li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Recent high school graduates gather at a remote cabin for a celebration. What begins as a night of laughter spirals into a tense mystery full of secrets, twists, and chilling choices. Who will survive? Navigate friendships, and uncover the multi-layered mystery in Shadows of Betrayal.",
